      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<article class=\"kairali-page kairali-consultation\">\n  <header>\n    <p>Speak with the Kairali consultation team</p>\n    <h1>Free Online Ayurveda Consultation</h1>\n    <p>Use the consultation form on this page to request a conversation about general Ayurveda, Kairali products and the next appropriate step. The team will review your request and contact you using the details you provide.</p>\n    <p><a href=\"#consultation-form\">Request a consultation</a> <a href=\"/collections/all\">Explore Kairali products</a></p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2>What the online consultation can help with</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Understanding the information needed before choosing a Kairali product.</li>\n      <li>Reviewing general product-use questions, label directions and practical considerations.</li>\n      <li>Identifying when a question should instead be taken to an appropriate healthcare professional.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>The consultation does not provide emergency care and does not guarantee diagnosis, treatment, cure or a particular result. Product availability and suitability remain subject to the individual product label and your circumstances.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2>Before you submit the form</h2>\n    <p>Give clear contact details and a concise explanation of what you would like to discuss. Do not submit passwords, payment-card details or emergency information. If you have urgent or severe symptoms, contact local emergency services or an appropriate medical professional instead of waiting for an online response.</p>\n    <p>If your question relates to pregnancy or breastfeeding, a child, allergies, a diagnosed condition or medicines, say so clearly and seek advice from an appropriately qualified healthcare professional before using a product.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"consultation-form\">\n    <h2>Request your online consultation</h2>\n    <p>Complete the consultation form displayed by this page. Submission is a request, not confirmation of an appointment. Please check that your telephone number and email address are accurate so the team can respond.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <h3>Is the online Ayurveda consultation free?</h3>\n    <p>The current page offers a free online consultation request. Any product purchase or separate service is optional and should be clearly confirmed before payment.</p>\n    <h3>Will the consultation diagnose or treat a condition?</h3>\n    <p>No diagnosis, cure or treatment outcome is promised. The service is for general Ayurveda and product-related guidance and does not replace appropriate medical care.</p>\n    <h3>Is submitting the form an appointment confirmation?</h3>\n    <p>No. The submission asks the team to review your request and contact you. Availability and the consultation format are confirmed separately.</p>\n    <h3>Where can I find a Kairali centre?</h3>\n    <p>See the <a href=\"/pages/find-our-store\">Kairali store and centre directory</a> for the locations and contact information currently listed by Kairali.</p>\n  </section>\n</article>"
      }
    },
